    "text": "# Flight-recorder profile for the Replay Lab golden evidence.\n#\n# A reduced go2 profile: the HELIX motion-arbitration topics plus two GO2\n# periodic telemetry topics (odometry and lowstate, both from the robot\n# host), so a replay can tell one silent topic from a whole host going\n# silent. Rates are lowered to 20 Hz to keep the committed bundles small;\n# that is a fixture choice, not a GO2 measurement (the GO2 publishes\n# robot_odom at ~150 Hz and lowstate at ~500 Hz, docs/go2_field_notes.md).\n\nprofile: replay_lab_fixture\nschema_version: 1\ndescription: >-\n  Reduced GO2 + HELIX profile for the Replay Lab golden evidence (synthetic).\n\nbuffer:\n  pre_trigger_sec: 10.0\n  post_trigger_sec: 3.0\n\nsampling:\n  graph_poll_sec: 0.5\n  system_sample_hz: 2.0\n  health_tick_sec: 0.25\n\nco_hosted_roles:\n  - helix_fault\n  - recovery_hint\n  - recovery_action\n  - helix_hold\n  - arbiter_status\n  - cmd_vel_out\n  - cmd_vel_source\n\nexpected_nodes:\n  - /helix_arbiter\n  - /helix_recovery_node\n\ntopics:\n  - name: /nav/cmd_vel\n    type: geometry_msgs/msg/Twist\n    role: cmd_vel_source\n  - name: /teleop/cmd_vel\n    type: geometry_msgs/msg/Twist\n    role: cmd_vel_source\n  - name: /cmd_vel\n    type: geometry_msgs/msg/Twist\n    role: cmd_vel_out\n  - name: /helix/faults\n    type: helix_msgs/msg/FaultEvent\n    role: helix_fault\n  - name: /helix/recovery_hints\n    type: helix_msgs/msg/RecoveryHint\n    role: recovery_hint\n  - name: /helix/recovery_actions\n    type: helix_msgs/msg/RecoveryAction\n    role: recovery_action\n  - name: /helix/hold\n    type: helix_msgs/msg/HelixHold\n    role: helix_hold\n    stale_after_sec: 0.5\n  - name: /helix/arbiter/status\n    type: helix_msgs/msg/ArbiterStatus\n    role: arbiter_status\n    stale_after_sec: 0.5\n  - name: /utlidar/robot_odom\n    type: nav_msgs/msg/Odometry\n    role: odometry\n    stale_after_sec: 0.5\n    frame_ids: {header.frame_id: odom, child_frame_id: base_link}\n  - name: /lowstate\n    type: unitree_go/msg/LowState\n    role: go2_state\n    stale_after_sec: 0.5\n",
